site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-05-18T12:13:26Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T16:22:55Z","closed_at":"2026-05-19T16:22:55Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.7.beta2.mono.official [777579205]\n- Not Reproducible in: v4.6.2.stable.mono.official [71f334935]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.beta2.mono - Windows 10 (build 17134) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 (NVIDIA; 31.0.15.3141) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-7700 CPU @ 3.60GHz (8 threads) - 23.92 GiB memory - WASAPI (96000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe CSG performance took a big hit in 4.7, which is likely a bug.\nIt has similar performance as before when autosmooth is turned on and uses an autosmooth angle a 0.\nIt can even be noticeable in the editor if you mode the nodes too fast.\n\nBut here is a stress test in 4.7 barely getting 2 FPS at some points. (even intersect barely reaches 15 fps)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/72f46a39-0730-48be-8840-ece950d664cc\n\n---\n**Here is what it used to be in Godot 4.6 as a comparison**\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b20a2238-8f5d-4b50-ab49-2c9a2c52b184\n\n---\n**And here is the strange problem.**\nWhen you turn on `autosmooth` with the angle of 0. It works with similar performance as before.\nBut changing the autosmooth angle makes it worse again (see end of video)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/72e8371f-b408-41e7-880c-23f51509adee\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Add a CSGCombiner with CSG inside\n- Make the child move at runtime to stress test it\nResult: Very bad performance, compared to before.\nExpected: Similar performance as 4.6\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nHere is the project for testing:\n- Click to move the CSG back and forth 2x\n- Right click to toggle between operation modes\n\n[MRP_csg_performance.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27958454/MRP_csg_performance.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119543/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119543/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}